~ cassie
if is_quest_done("help_cassie")
	=> cassie_ledger
if has_item("showcase_key")
	Cassie: You still have my key. The door is right there. Why are you still looking at me?
	=> END
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: You. You walked away from me. Everyone does. I keep a list. You are on it now.
elif get_level_flag("showcase.met")
	Cassie: You came back. They never come back. Are you real this time?
else
	Cassie: Oh. Hi. Do not move. Please. When people move they leave, and when they leave I forget their faces.
	% Cassie: You have a face I could forget.
	% Cassie: I knew someone with your hands. Or I will. It is hard to tell the direction.
	% Cassie: You are the first. You are the third. I am not sure which is worse.
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.met")
	## Flavor, no effect.
	- How long have you been here?
		Cassie: I used to count the days. Then the days stopped. Now I count the people who leave.
	- Say nothing
		Cassie: Good. Quiet is good. Quiet means you are still here.
Cassie: There is a door. I cannot open it. I tried until my hands stopped working. Will you?
- Help her
	$> add_sanity(10)
	$> give_item("showcase_key")
	if get_quest_stage("help_cassie") == -1
		$> advance_quest("help_cassie")
	$> add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: Here. My key. The last one who held it went through and did not come back.
	Cassie: You will come back. Right?
	## No answer on purpose, she does not want one.
	Cassie: That was not a question I wanted answered. Take it. Please.
- Ignore her
	$> add_sanity(-20)
	$> add_opinion("cassie", -1)
	Cassie: Right. Fine. It is fine. I will just stand here. I am very good at standing here.
=> END


~ cassie_ledger
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: The door is open. I am grateful. I am. I also remember you leaving. I see it every time I close my eyes.
else
	Cassie: You opened it. You came back and you opened it. Nobody comes back.
Cassie: I owe you {{get_favor("cassie")}}. I count it at night. I count it during the day too. There is no difference here.
- Hate. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /]
	if give_item("aspect_of_hate")
		$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
		Cassie: Take it. One hate. It whispers when I hold it. It says things about you.
	else
		Cassie: Your hands are full. I will keep the favor. I keep everything. I cannot let anything go.
- What does the fairy want? One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /]
	$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
	$> set_fact("choice.cassie_told")
	Cassie: She waits at the gate. She smiles while she takes. She took something from me once. I do not remember what. That is how I know it mattered.
- Talk to the fairy for me. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 and get_debt("fairy") >= 1 /]
	$> add_favor("cassie", -1)
	$> add_debt("fairy", -1)
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Cassie: I talked to her. Your debt is gone. She looked at me the whole time. She has not stopped looking.
## Repeatable, the loaf never runs out.
- Take this bread. [if has_item("bread") /]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> add_favor("cassie", 1)
	$> add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: For me? I forgot what food tastes like. I forgot a lot of things.
	Cassie: [#sanity_glitch] I will not forget that you brought it. I will keep it where I keep the other things.
	Cassie: I owe you one more.
- Leave
	Cassie: Okay. Go. I will be here. I am always here.
=> END

